WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.773
Here's how to manage your PollSlide account: your password, your email address, and your data.

2
00:00:05.724 --> 00:00:08.115
Everything about your account is in one place.

3
00:00:08.115 --> 00:00:11.131
Click your avatar at the top right, then Account settings.

4
00:00:12.082 --> 00:00:17.295
To change your password, type your current one, then the new one twice, and click Change password.

5
00:00:17.295 --> 00:00:18.679
Forgotten the current one?

6
00:00:18.679 --> 00:00:20.434
There's a reset link right below.

7
00:00:23.709 --> 00:00:28.721
To change your email, enter the new address and your current password, and click Send confirmation link.

8
00:00:28.721 --> 00:00:33.828
Nothing changes until you click the link we send to the new address, and we let your old address know too.

9
00:00:34.779 --> 00:00:38.230
Until you confirm, you keep signing in with your current address.

10
00:00:38.230 --> 00:00:41.521
Your presentations, results and plan stay exactly as they are.

11
00:00:42.471 --> 00:00:48.748
Under Your data, you can download a copy of everything: your presentations, questions, and the answers they collected.

12
00:00:49.699 --> 00:00:53.918
And if you ever want to leave, Delete account removes everything permanently.

13
00:00:53.918 --> 00:00:57.589
A paid plan simply stops renewing, so there are no further charges.

14
00:00:58.541 --> 00:00:59.710
Sign in with Google?

15
00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:05.909
Then your password and email are managed by Google, and we can move your presentations for you. Questions?

16
00:01:05.909 --> 00:01:07.370
Email help@pollslide.com.
